## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical multi-region ECS deployment skills, cost-aware traffic shaping, and robust rollback DR planning under real-world constraints.

## Key Concepts
- Cross-region ECS Fargate deployment with CDK
- Route 53 latency-based routing and weighted canaries
- Per-branch preview environments and cost-aware rollbacks

## Code Example
```typescript
// CDK sketch for multi-region ECS services (pseudo-structure)
import { App } from 'aws-cdk-lib';
import { EcsStack } from './ecs-stack';
const app = new App();
new EcsStack(app, 'RegionA', { env: { region: 'us-east-1' } });
new EcsStack(app, 'RegionB', { env: { region: 'us-west-2' } });
new EcsStack(app, 'RegionC', { env: { region: 'eu-central-1' } });
app.synth();
```

